      </p>

      <h2>联系方式</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>邮箱：</strong><a href="mailto:43716313@qq.com">43716313@qq.com</a></li>
        <li><strong>电话：</strong><a href="tel:+86 18900996113">+86 18900996113</a></li>
        <li><strong>地址：</strong>大连市中山区中山路136号希望大厦35层</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>免责声明</h2>
